          "title": "先读懂专业概念",
          "html": "<figure class=\"lb-plate\"><style>\nfigure.lb-plate{padding:0!important;margin:22px 0!important;background:#0d1928!important;border:1px solid #294353!important;border-radius:18px!important;overflow:hidden;color:#dce9ee;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 18px 42px #12293418}\n.lb-plate .lb-head{padding:28px 30px 18px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#192d40,#102332 70%,#153b3d);border-bottom:1px solid #2d4555}.lb-plate .lb-kicker{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:2px;color:#7ccec2}.lb-plate .lb-head h3{font-size:26px!important;line-height:1.5!important;letter-spacing:.3px;color:#eff7fa!important;margin:9px 0!important}.lb-plate .lb-head p{font-size:13px!important;color:#9eb6c3!important;margin:0!important;line-height:1.8}.lb-plate .lb-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:18px 30px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.lb-plate .lb-tools span{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#98b1bf}.lb-plate .lb-tools b{font-weight:500;color:#6bd5c4}.lb-plate>input{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0}.lb-plate .lb-switch{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin:17px 0 10px 30px;padding:9px 13px;border:1px solid #395264;border-radius:7px;color:#a5bdca;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;background:#152738}.lb-plate .lb-switch:before{content:'';width:24px;height:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#435a6b;box-shadow:inset 10px 0 #aac0cb;transition:.2s}.lb-plate #lb-correct:checked~label[for=lb-correct],.lb-plate #lb-scan:checked~label[for=lb-scan]{color:#88e6d5;border-color:#377c75;background:#163b3c}.lb-plate #lb-correct:checked~label[for=lb-correct]:before,.lb-plate #lb-scan:checked~label[for=lb-scan]:before{background:#255c58;box-shadow:inset -10px 0 #77e2cd}.lb-plate>input:focus-visible+label{outline:2px solid #e3c28c;outline-offset:3px}.lb-plate .lb-scroll{overflow-x:auto;padding:0 18px}.lb-plate .lb-scroll>svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:880px;height:auto!important;max-height:none!important}.lb-plate .lb-comp{opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s}.lb-plate #lb-correct:checked~.lb-scroll .lb-comp{opacity:1}.lb-plate .lb-sweep{opacity:0;animation:lb-depth 12s linear infinite;animation-play-state:paused}.lb-plate #lb-scan:checked~.lb-scroll .lb-sweep{opacity:1;animation-play-state:running}.lb-plate .lb-hover{cursor:help}.lb-plate .lb-hover:hover .lb-zone{fill:#d5a85c;fill-opacity:.2}.lb-plate .lb-bottom{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;background:#2a3c4b;border-top:1px solid #2d4555;margin-top:4px}.lb-plate .lb-bottom>div{padding:20px 24px;background:#122232}.lb-plate .lb-bottom small{color:#76c9b8;font:10px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:1px}.lb-plate .lb-bottom h4{font-size:15px!important;color:#d8e8ed!important;margin:7px 0!important}.lb-plate .lb-bottom p{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.9;color:#9db2bf!important;margin:0!important}.lb-plate .lb-detail{margin:0;padding:18px 26px;background:#0e1d2b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#9eb5c0;border-top:1px solid #293e4c}.lb-plate .lb-detail summary{color:#b8d7df;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}.lb-plate .lb-detail p{font-size:12px!important;color:#a8bec8!important}.lb-plate .lb-caption{padding:14px 26px!important;font-size:11px!important;line-height:1.9;color:#819eaf!important;background:#0d1928!important}.lb-plate .lb-caption a{color:#93c6ce}.lb-plate .lb-legend{font-size:11px;fill:#a2bac8}@keyframes lb-depth{from{transform:translateY(0)}to{transform:translateY(378px)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.lb-plate .lb-sweep{animation:none!important}.lb-plate .lb-comp{transition:none}}@media(max-width:700px){.lb-plate .lb-head{padding:22px}.lb-plate .lb-head h3{font-size:22px!important}.lb-plate .lb-bottom{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lb-plate .lb-switch{margin-left:20px}.lb-plate .lb-tools{padding-left:22px}}\n</style><div class=\"lb-head\"><span class=\"lb-kicker\">DRILLING TIME / 地层与工况联合判读</span><h3>一次曲线转折，两种可能的来源。</h3><p>沿同一井深，追踪地层参考、工况变化与钻时响应。叠加补偿曲线，看清哪些变化随工况消失。</p></div>\n<div class=\"lb-tools\"><span>井段 <b>2000—2160 m</b></span><span>深度向下递增 ↓</span><span>教学剖面 / 非现场测井成果</span></div>\n<input id=\"lb-correct\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><label class=\"lb-switch\" for=\"lb-correct\">叠加工况补偿曲线</label><input id=\"lb-scan\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><label class=\"lb-switch\" for=\"lb-scan\">深度引导动画</label>\n<div class=\"lb-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"钻时联合判读面板，窄屏可横向查看\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1180 630\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"把专业场景画出来：同深度地层纹理、工况区间与双曲线对照\">\n<defs>\n<pattern id=\"lb-dots\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><circle cx=\"3\" cy=\"4\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#d3bc87\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"10\" r=\".7\" fill=\"#c9ad7b\" opacity=\".4\"/></pattern>\n<pattern id=\"lb-beds\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 3h16M9 9h15\" stroke=\"#79aaba\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/></pattern>\n<pattern id=\"lb-cross\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 16L16 0M-8 8L8-8M8 24L24 8\" stroke=\"#a0bbaa\" stroke-width=\".6\" opacity=\".4\"/></pattern>\n<pattern id=\"lb-bricks\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 0H28M0 8H28M14 0v8M0 8v8M28 8v8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a0a1b7\" stroke-width=\".8\" opacity=\".4\"/></pattern>\n<linearGradient id=\"lb-area\"><stop stop-color=\"#eab975\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#eab975\" stop-opacity=\".2\"/></linearGradient>\n</defs>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"70\" width=\"810\" height=\"495\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#101f2e\" stroke=\"#2c4354\"/>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#e1edf1\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">同深度多道对照</text><text x=\"850\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#e1edf1\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\">读图线索</text>\n<path d=\"M452 29h24\" stroke=\"#e8b470\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"484\" y=\"33\" class=\"lb-legend\">原始钻时</text><path d=\"M575 29h24\" stroke=\"#64dfc3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"607\" y=\"33\" class=\"lb-legend\">补偿后钻时</text><path d=\"M714 29h24\" stroke=\"#728da1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"746\" y=\"33\" class=\"lb-legend\">参考层界</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"101\" fill=\"#809eaf\" font-size=\"11\">井深 / m</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"101\" fill=\"#cee0e7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">01 地层参考</text><text x=\"338\" y=\"101\" fill=\"#cee0e7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">02 工况因子</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"101\" fill=\"#cee0e7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">03 钻时响应</text>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"124\" fill=\"#7f9cae\" font-size=\"10\">纹理仅用于区分参考层段</text><text x=\"339\" y=\"124\" fill=\"#7f9cae\" font-size=\"10\">已知设定 / 无量纲</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"124\" fill=\"#7f9cae\" font-size=\"10\">min/m · 数值越小，钻进越快</text>\n<rect x=\"139\" y=\"150.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"#655a42\"/><rect x=\"139\" y=\"150.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"url(#lb-dots)\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"180.0\" width=\"68\" height=\"29\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#112333\" fill-opacity=\".83\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"199.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e0e8e7\" font-size=\"12\">层段 A</text><rect x=\"139\" y=\"245.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"#304d60\"/><rect x=\"139\" y=\"245.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"url(#lb-beds)\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"275.0\" width=\"68\" height=\"29\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#112333\" fill-opacity=\".83\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"294.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e0e8e7\" font-size=\"12\">层段 B</text><rect x=\"139\" y=\"340.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"#405b51\"/><rect x=\"139\" y=\"340.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"url(#lb-cross)\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"370.0\" width=\"68\" height=\"29\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#112333\" fill-opacity=\".83\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"389.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e0e8e7\" font-size=\"12\">层段 C</text><rect x=\"139\" y=\"435.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"#484858\"/><rect x=\"139\" y=\"435.0\" width=\"147\" height=\"95\" fill=\"url(#lb-bricks)\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"46